				14
			],
			"Message": "feat(Monorepo): Implement DNS-based security infrastructure with TLS and local DNS resolver\n\nThis commit introduces a comprehensive defense-in-depth security architecture across the Land ecosystem, enabling secure local HTTPS services and isolated network communication.\n\n## New Element: Mist (DNS Server)\n- Introduces **Mist**, a new DNS server element built on Hickory DNS\n- Creates a secure sandbox resolving `*.editor.land` domains exclusively to localhost (127.0.0.1)\n- Provides `LandDnsResolver` implementing `reqwest::dns::Resolve` for HTTP client integration\n- Implements loopback-only binding, defense-in-depth IP validation, and forward allowlist\n\n## Mountain: TLS Infrastructure & DNS Integration\n- Adds `CertificateManager` for PKI with root CA stored in OS keyring\n- Generates ECDSA P-256 server certificates signed by the CA\n- Implements `ServiceRegistry` for mapping `land://` domain names to local HTTP ports\n- Adds `land://` custom URI scheme handler for webview isolation\n- Starts Hickory DNS server on port 5380 and registers DNS Tauri commands\n- Updates CSP in tauri.conf.json to allow `land:` protocol\n\n## Air: Secured HTTP Clients\n- Creates `Source/HTTP/client.rs` with `secured_client()` functions using custom DNS resolver\n- Routes all HTTP traffic through local DNS server ensuring `*.editor.land` → `127.x.x.x`\n- Updates `Downloader` and `Updates` modules to use secured clients\n- Adds `rustls-native-certs` and `Mist` workspace dependencies\n\n## SideCar: DNS Override for Sidecar Spawning\n- Transforms into Tauri 2.x application with shell plugin integration\n- Adds `Resource/dns-override.js` to patch Node.js DNS module for Hickory resolution\n- Creates `Spawn::spawn_node_sidecar` function injecting DNS override via NODE_OPTIONS\n\n## Grove & Rest: Rust Dependency Updates\n- **Grove**: Major updates to tokio 1.49, wasmtime 42, tonic 0.12, opentelemetry 0.31\n- **Rest**: Updates toml, swc ecosystem, and various build dependencies\n\n## Dependency Updates (Various Elements)\n- **Cocoon/Wind**: effect 3.19.19, @effect/language-service, google-protobuf, @types/node\n- **Common/Echo**: @cloudflare/workers-types (multiple updates)\n- **Echo**: wrangler 4.69.0, miniflare 4.20260305.0\n- **Sky**: astro 5.18.0\n- **Output/Worker**: @types/node, @types/serviceworker\n- **Multiple**: actions/upload-artifact 7.0.0 (major update)\n\nThis establishes the foundation for secure local service discovery, gRPC communication via DNS isolation, and HTTPS webview serving within the Land architecture.",
			"SHA": "b65affa3b2d2d8cf40d9581551a97c079a98ec59"
		}
